In the Rectangle class, the comment "# this is how tall" refers to the height of the rectangle, which should be a positive integer. In the function func, the comment "# height of r is positive" refers to the height of the rectangle instance r should be positive.

So, an assertion for this condition is added as "assert r.exp > 0".
